Change From Baseline in Weight to Week 52, Baseline to Week 52|Change From Baseline in Fasting Plasma Glucose to Week 52, Baseline to Week 52|Number of Subjects Achieving Week 52 HbA1c Levels Less Than or Equal to 7.0%, Week 52|Incidence of Total Hypoglycemia, Defined as hypoglycemic symptoms that are relieved with carbohydrate intake or blood glucose measurement \<= 63 mg/dL, regardless of symptoms., 52 Weeks|Incidence of Severe Hypoglycemia, Severe hypoglycemia occurs when all 3 of the following occur simultaneously:

